#title: HS2 uniform-cover half-space ablation reference v0.1 (cover full depth, no rock interface; materials through PML); clean differencing reference for the HS1 interface echo - surface contrast identical to HS1 (cover-air); frozen numerics identical to B3D5CM-t07
#domain_mode: 3D
#domain: 12 12 33
#dx_dy_dz: 0.05 0.05 0.05
#time_window: 600e-9
#omp_threads: 8
#pml_cells: 20 20 20 20 20 20
#pml_formulation: HORIPML
#waveform: impulse 1 1 impulse
#hertzian_dipole: x 6 5.35 27 impulse
#rx: 6 6.65 27 hs2 Ex
#pml_cfs: constant forward 0 0 constant forward 1 1 quartic forward 0 0.21235349838321013
#material: 18.017 0.003 1 0 cover
#add_dispersion_debye: 1 7.878 6.4567e-09 cover
#box: 0 0 0 12 12 12 cover
